############################################################
###################### BASIC CRUD TESTS ####################
############################################################

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8080

### Create Engineer (No Security – for early phase testing)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pranshu",
  "techStack": "Java, Spring Boot"
}

### Get All Engineers
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer

### Get Engineer By ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/2

### Update Engineer
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/4
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pranshu Patel",
  "techStack": "Java, Spring Boot, Docker"
}

### Delete Engineer
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer/7


############################################################
################ PAGINATION & FILTER TESTS #################
############################################################

### Explicit Pagination
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=2

### Sorting
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=5&sort=id,asc
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?page=0&size=5&sort=id,desc

### Filtering
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?name=an
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?techStack=java
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer?name=an&techStack=java


############################################################
#################### SECURITY PHASE TESTS ##################
############################################################

################ PUBLIC ENDPOINTS ################

### Register USER
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_phase2",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

### Register ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_phase2",
  "password": "1234",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN"
}

### Login USER
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user_phase2",
  "password": "1234"
}

### Login ADMIN
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin_phase2",
  "password": "1234"
}


################ PROTECTED ENDPOINT TESTS ################

### USER → GET (Allowed)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>

### USER → POST (Should Return 403)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Authorization: Bearer <USER_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "User Attempt",
  "techStack": "Java"
}

### ADMIN → POST (Should Return 201)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer
Authorization: Bearer <ADMIN_TOKEN>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Admin Success",
  "techStack": "Spring Boot"
}

### No Token → Should Return 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/software-engineer


